    "rich_text_rfQaaT": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_cjbHHR": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Subscribe + Save on Your Terms",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_ijwQhL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Most people don't notice how much better they feel until they realize they've been consistent for a while. That's what a subscription does — it just keeps you going without making it a thing.<\/p><p>When you subscribe, you save 20% on every order, automatically. No codes, no remembering. It's just there.<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset2",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        }
      },
