        "text_TYVmN9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We've been doing this for over twenty years. We know that feeling better takes consistency — and consistency takes trust. So we built a subscription that works the way you need it to, not the way most companies need it to.<\/p><p>When you're ready, we're here.<\/p>",
